              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeheeleesiina gideaba gilakweay gajeeyeana gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA haghweega madeeda bea ng'eanyiideanya, ea haghweega madeeda sean bea gilinyoo ea geeta gil; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.35",
