          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ashoohoocheanda, was orjeeda Haruni, gaygwandeayi sea fuga Lawi, damanda ang'waanya fuga Lawi gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush; ak fuga Lawi gaygweadu gooscheeng'u gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea gheeda ASEETEANYA, bea ghushuutka heeda siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
