              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga Israeli ea orjooga Lawi gaygweadu haleanjeeda sisapa geadi was booga, ea difaayi, ea nagheeda ghushuutka, was heeda mida dabita heeda ghaydit ea ashoohoodiga gadiiyi, ea furiischoodiga fur dooshta, ea fuga sarmani. Ak aseasa ea majeenung'usiina heeda gheeda ASEETEANYA.",
          "type": "text",
